{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:66150dedfb2d6b7a","name":"Increase Vehicle Speed","source":{"id":"source:reference-66150dedfb2d6b7a","title":"Increase Vehicle Speed","revision":18278,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:53:35Z","sha256":"10b4a8e18a3e332749802dfd0ff32be103401f802458912cb14dc371817020dc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18278","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Increase%20Vehicle%20Speed&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-66150dedfb2d6b7a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," skill and acting as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"},", you may make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to push your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," beyond its normal limits. (You can't ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on this check.) If the check fails, your Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," does not increase, and your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," moves -1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". If you succeed, your Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," increases by 1 square until the end of your next turn. For every 5 points by which you exceed the DC, your Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," increases by an additional 1 square.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You may attempt to Increase Vehicle Speed once per round as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},", when using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["All-Out Movement"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/All-Out_Movement","referenceId":"reference:c3e269326f94373b"}," Action.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
